            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "GingerBlue"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The flavor of these is very good, but the texture is kind of greasy. The cookies aren't chewy, rather they're crumbly like old shortbread cookies, leaving a greasy feel on your fingers.",
